# Deeply nested function calls exceed MAX_CONTINUATION_STACK=2048
# Each recursive call adds continuation frames (Memoize, etc.)
# Use a Y-combinator style recursive function to build depth
[f: [fn [self n] [if [= n 0] 0 [+ 1 [call self self [- n 1]]]]]
 result: [call f f 2100]]
=== error
[E040] depth exceeded
